{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81e7fa3160789998bbb0bd35a7898d14592213a79bb4eea600f98a0dbd3ab5cc", "ja": "（アイドル達がサーカスに挑戦した公演での綱渡りが\n評判になり、可奈がTVに出演することになった！）", "zh": "（在偶像们挑战马戏团表演的公演中，\n可奈表演的走钢索大受好评，因此受邀上电视节目了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c6fc3773ff2520d0a46b8e24c3420d20b6b92fb8a4c53b0c6aad6bf026ae11d", "ja": "すうぅ～……はあぁ～……。\nすうぅ～……はあぁ～……。", "zh": "（吸气～～吐气～～）\n（吸气～～吐气～～）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "125f81a311520d4a02389a38c43efe89278e9d2d409e5f47f10a17e7e0af54e0", "ja": "（……が、さっきから可奈の様子がおかしい。\nもしかして、緊張しているのか……？）", "zh": "（……但可奈从刚才开始就怪怪的，\n该不会在紧张吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "2d4cfdfa546a2cb4aa0577e05c42f336d2c926648cf4da100357af97a7c1eea8", "ja": "ううっ、{$P$}さぁん！\n私、さっきから挨拶の練習をしてるんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生～！\n我从刚刚就一直在练习打招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "42e1f1150cf02ea05b0a8a7f3c476107d373f34d334631b9da6bb66aaad097f4", "ja": "私、なんだかすごく緊張してるみたいで。\n同じところで噛んじゃうんです～！", "zh": "但我好像太紧张了，\n一直在同个地方吃螺丝～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "d47aab388f1e147798f0b049b96a0aae663e847973ae56c4be403c25d7d58854", "ja": "どうしちゃったんだろう？\n劇場では、こんなに緊張してなかったのに～。", "zh": "我到底怎么了？\n在剧场明明不会这么紧张的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ca57661e5bfc0e47803473456b352511798f83346ac9c82534abf846a30dfa9c", "ja": "TVだし、普段の劇場とは違うからな……\n緊張するのは仕方がないよ。", "zh": "毕竟是上电视，跟平常的剧场表演不一样嘛……\n会紧张也是正常的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a10e06c2596f362a28fdc4c6150b0cfc5a46e4bca929a4faca8d644d4bf5d58", "ja": "そうなのかな……どうなのかな……？\nうう、考え始めたらソワソワしてきちゃいました！", "zh": "是这样吗……是怎样呢……？\n呜呜，一旦开始思考就会觉得坐立不安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "482caeaf7b8e66afddaa0389e76899d9241c5d31ed9b967d5e504322842960a0", "ja": "そう言えば可奈、今日は\nいつもみたいに歌わないんだな。", "zh": "这么说来，可奈，\n你今天不像平常一样一直唱歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "9bc0d718ce24f05a457585801daf47c6637cabe5b711c8550a09703af20d838f", "ja": "え？　そうですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c406826d9938220f42598aac14ac5fcee4d481ed231f721f1ff919f7f8a9ea2a", "ja": "うん。さっきのも、いつもだったら「そうなのかな～♪\nどうなのかな～♪」って感じで……。", "zh": "嗯，比如刚刚的对话，平常的你应该会\n「是这样吗～♪是怎样呢～♪」这样唱出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "f789653f5f411d45a3e4f43ca53611b2360eff98001ec1ab314b0885913110b9", "ja": "ああっ、本当です！？　緊張してるせいか、\n歌うのも忘れちゃってました……。", "zh": "啊啊，真的耶！？\n可能是因为紧张吧，我都忘记要唱歌了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4ecc7aa54469a221ece0ea96f04c393468a59a447dd229eeb2eb261f8a012a45", "ja": "考えすぎるから、緊張しちゃうのかもしれないな。\n考えるな、って言っても難しいだろうけど……。", "zh": "也许是因为想太多才紧张起来的，\n不过叫你别去想也不太可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e5b0cfe30c449b0be117642b3eae3c632acf1b35f0ec765ad4bff56a361c9c4a", "ja": "可奈が楽しそうだから、見てる人も楽しいんだ。\n最後まで、笑顔を忘れないようにしような！", "zh": "但只要可奈你开心，看到你的人也会开心的。\n到最后都不要忘记笑容喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "ec5673b45f40e9a9bf904d3bd2977a491c490047efd4df88ce353e4067c88c3d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nそうですよね！　考えない……のは、ムリですけど。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你说得没错！虽然不太可能不去想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "4606d78ca239c1871116658312227460b83cf6ad91a906817a769ac8e0b592b9", "ja": "緊張してない～♪　怖くなんてない～♪\n本番まで時間もない～♪　けど問題もない～♪", "zh": "一点也不紧张～♪一点也不可怕～♪\n很快就要上场～♪但不会有问题～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1016_p", "source_sha256": "00003b8f575caf2127a1596d0fb9f0486be1ebeec69306a22f19b2da566cde6f", "ja": "おお、いつもどおりの可奈だな！\nその調子だ！", "zh": "喔喔，恢复成一如往常的可奈了！\n继续保持！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "a28433596468bea0d9ef79aa7f3a8fd04fc7a6e03f98ffb40c36de8e071ee066", "ja": "開幕の挨拶～♪　可奈の挨拶～♪\n歌と一緒～♪　イッツ・ショータ～イム♪", "zh": "开幕打招呼～♪可奈打招呼～♪\n一边唱着歌～♪It's showtime～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1018_p", "source_sha256": "db52dabe1943c3f2588fbc6e424abb2a6e085f6164cab17bcbd6e02c5960a5ee", "ja": "いい感じだぞ、可奈！\nその調子で本番に臨もう！", "zh": "很不错喔，可奈！\n就这样迎接正式录影吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "f254e51c09180e3eee16347ac2d752169de25c7d28bd64b1e65d2b4c2c61ac9c", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さん、\n私、がんばれそうです！", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n我可以提起精神面对录影了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0134_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c50cd05c2486dd4331cfc509bf9cb36a4e30b2503fbdb0933e3b9f02d07ed8e", "ja": "本番楽しみだな～、な～！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "好期待正式录影喔～你说对吧～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
